      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "aliases: \n",
        "  - /Data/Sentinel2.html#sentinel-2-l2a-baselines\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  html:\n",
        "    code-fold: true\n",
        "execute:\n",
        "  echo: false\n",
        "  output: asis\n",
        "jupyter: python3\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "##### Sentinel-2 L2A Baselines\n",
        "\n",
        "The Sentinel-2 L2A collection within the Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem originates from two sources: \n",
        "\n",
        "**(1)** operational Copernicus processing, i.e. data previously accessible on the Copernicus Open Access Hub (formerly known as Sentinels Scientific Data Hub);\n",
        " \n",
        "**(2)** reprocessing of the L2A archive from 2015 until the end of 2021 [(Collection 1)](https://sentinel.esa.int/web/sentinel/sentinel-data-access/sentinel-products/sentinel-2-data-products/collection-1-level-2a){target=\"_blank\"}, and ;\n",
        "\n",
        "These products can be differentiated by the [OData](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/OData.html#query-by-attributes){target=\"_blank\"} and [OpenSearch](https://catalogue.dataspace.copernicus.eu/resto/api/collections/Sentinel2/describe.xml){target=\"_blank\"} **(origin)** attribute (ESA or CloudFerro) and by the **'processingBaseline'** attribute. Processing Baseline is presented on Copernicus Browser as a \"Processor version\" attribute.\n",
        "\n",
        "The current state of the archive of the Sentinel-L2A data is as follows:\n",
        "\n",
        "<table class=\"table-roadmap\" style=\"margin: 10px;\">\n",
        "  <thead>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <th style=\"background-color: #9ea1a5\">Availability of S-2 L2A products based on sensing date</th>\n",
        "      <th style=\"background-color: #9ea1a5\">Processing Baseline</th>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "  </thead>\n",
        "  <tbody>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>04/07/2015 - 21/05/2021</td>\n",
        "      <td>Processing Baselines 2.05 -2.13 <br>(originating from Copernicus Open Access Hub and generated by CloudFerro)</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>04/02/2020 - 30/03/2021</td>\n",
        "      <td>Processing Baseline 2.14 <br>(originating from Copernicus Open Access Hub) <br>(Attribute ‘processorVersion’: 02.14)</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>25/01/2022 - 06/12/2022</td>\n",
        "      <td>Processing Baseline 4.00 <br>(originating from Copernicus Open Access Hub) <br>(Attribute ‘processorVersion’: 04.00 or 4.0)</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>29/04/2022 - 13/12/2023</td>\n",
        "      <td>Processing Baseline 5.09 <br>(originating from Copernicus Open Access Hub and Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem) <br>(Attribute ‘processorVersion’: 05.09 or 5.09)</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>13/12/2023 - Now</td>\n",
        "      <td>Processing Baseline 5.10 <br>(originating from Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem) <br>(Attribute ‘processorVersion’: 05.10 or 5.10)</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>23/07/2024 - Now</td>\n",
        "      <td>Processing Baseline 05.11 <br>(originating from Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem) <br>(Attribute ‘processorVersion’: 05.11 or 5.11)</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "  </tbody>\n",
        "</table>\n",
        "\n",
        "For more information on baseline 05.11 see [Deployment of Sentinel-2 Processing Baseline in version 05.11 on 23 July](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/news/2024-7-19-deployment-sentinel-2-processing-baseline-version-0511-23-july){target=\"_blank\"} .\n",
        "\n",
        "##### Processing Baseline 5.00 and 5.10 for Sentinel-2 L1C and L2A\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "<table class=\"table-roadmap\" style=\"margin: 10px;\">\n",
        "  <thead>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <th style=\"background-color: #9ea1a5\">Updated availability by sensing time period</th>\n",
        "      <th style=\"background-color: #9ea1a5\">Sentinel-2A</th>\n",
        "      <th style=\"background-color: #9ea1a5\">Sentinel-2B</th>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "  </thead>\n",
        "  <tbody>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>Published (Processing baseline 05.00)</td>\n",
        "      <td>From 4 July 2015 to 31 December 2021 included</td>\n",
        "      <td>From 17 March 2017 to 31 December 2021 included</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "    <tr>\n",
        "      <td>Next period in list (Processing baseline 05.10)</td>\n",
        "      <td>From 1 January 2022 then continuing in chronological order sensing time, up to 13 December 2023</td>\n",
        "      <td>From January 1 2022 then continuing in chronological order of sensing time, up to 13 December 2023</td>\n",
        "    </tr>\n",
        "  </tbody>\n",
        "</table>"
      ],
      "id": "dd8b8a00"
    }
  ],
